<title>USA: American General acquires Hilton Hotel.</title>
<headline>American General acquires Hilton Hotel.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Hospitality Corp said on Wednesday it completed its plans to acquire a 152-room full-service Hilton Hotel in Durham, North Carolina for $12.1 million.</p>
<p>American General Hospitality Corp is a real estate investment trust (REIT) and an active owner of hotel real estate with a portfolio of 16 properties.</p>
</text>
